 "description": "Use this when the user wants a script for a short vertical video, such as \"write a 25-second TikTok and Reels script about our new app\". Pass the topic, with the facts to use, and 1 to 4 platforms from tiktok, youtube_shorts, instagram_reels, x_video; say in the topic if an AI-generated presenter or voice will be used. Returns a script on a fixed clock (hook 0 to 3 seconds, body 4 to 20 seconds, call to action by about 25 seconds) with voiceover, on-screen text and visuals, a timing check, a caption for each platform checked against its rules, each platform's official video length limit with its source, and an ai_disclosure block naming the AI label that applies when the script declares an AI-generated person or voice. Uses only the facts given. It does not publish, make the video, clone voices or write for fake-identity accounts.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "platforms": {
    "description": "Where the video will be posted: tiktok, youtube_shorts, instagram_reels, x_video.",
    "items": {
     "enum": [
      "tiktok",
      "youtube_shorts",
      "instagram_reels",
      "x_video"
     ],
     "type": "string"
    },
    "maxItems": 4,
    "minItems": 1,
    "type": "array"
   },
   "tone": {
    "description": "Optional voice, such as \"friendly and plain\" or \"dry humour\".",
    "maxLength": 80,
    "type": "string"
   },
   "topic": {
    "description": "What the video is about, with the facts to use. Say if it will use an AI-generated presenter or voice, so the right label is named.",
    "maxLength": 800,
    "minLength": 3,
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "topic",
   "platforms"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
